Package: speaker
Type: Package
Title: Direct Access to Praat C Functionality from R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Humlab Speech", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "humlab-speech@umu.se")
    )
Description: Provides direct, efficient access to Praat C implemented 
    functionality from R using Rcpp. Similar in concept to the parselmouth 
    package for Python, this package allows R users to leverage Praat's 
    powerful phonetic analysis capabilities directly.
